       ffcc--mmaattcchh ssaannss
              Display the  best  matching  font  categorized  into  sans-serif
              generic family, filtered by current locale

       ffcc--mmaattcchh ssaannss::llaanngg==eenn
              Display  the  best  matching  font  categorized  into sans-serif
